An unclosed fence under an open paragraph in a container opens nothing

````
::: note
para
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p>para</p>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````

